sequenceDiagram
  participant Client as C client
  participant Interface as Public interface
  participant Route as engine route
  participant Host as Host port
  participant Kvspace as kvspace facts
  participant Vmkv as vmkv
  participant Program as immutable BinRWIR Program
  participant Vmjit as vmjit
  participant Vmbin as vmbin

  Client->>Interface: structured execute request
  Interface->>Route: validated request
  Route->>Host: load function generation and state
  Host->>Kvspace: read RWIR values frame program counter status error
  Kvspace-->>Route: host-neutral snapshot
  Route->>Vmkv: compile RWIR snapshot
  Vmkv->>Program: build and finalize
  Program-->>Route: immutable Program or explicit failure
  Route->>Vmjit: try Program
  alt vmjit executed
    Vmjit-->>Route: structured outcome
  else vmjit fallback
    Vmjit-->>Route: fallback at observable boundary
    Route->>Vmbin: execute same Program and state
    Vmbin-->>Route: structured outcome
  end
  Route->>Host: commit effects then checkpoint
  Host->>Kvspace: values then program counter then status or error
  Route-->>Interface: structured result
  Interface-->>Client: status and result
